    "text": "By Shaira Arias ,\n1 days ago A new ordinance expands a curfew to more neighborhoods than just Kensington and will now force businesses to close up shop overnight. The new curfew goes into effect 11:59 p.m. on Wednesday, Sept. 10 for businesses in Germantown, Fairhill, Hunting Park, Frankford and Mount Airy as well as Kensington. All... Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 29",
